 "body": [
  "Fan Zhendong lost a Tischtennis Bundesliga singles match for the first time this season on Sunday, beaten 3-1 by Romania's Eduard Ionescu, but Borussia Düsseldorf still won 3-1 at 1. FC Saarbrücken, the champions, to make it nine wins from nine. Fan beat Patrick Franziska in straight games to win the match.",
  "Düsseldorf lead the table with 18 points, six clear of Saarbrücken and TTF Ochsenhausen, who play on Monday. TTC Bad Homburg won 3-2 at TSV Bad Königshofen in the doubles on Saturday, and TTC Fulda-Maberzell won 3-0 at ASC Grünwettersbach, with Dimitrij Ovtcharov winning two days after his quarter-final at WTT Star Contender Muscat.",
  "## Ionescu ends Fan's run",
  "Fan had won all eight of his league singles for Düsseldorf before Sunday, as Eleven reported after [his return against Grünwettersbach](/news/fan-zhendong-borussia-dusseldorf-return-unbeaten-bundesliga-2026.html) a week earlier. Ionescu, 22 and the world No 81, took the first two games 11-9 and 11-8; Fan pulled one back 11-8, but Ionescu won the fourth by the same score. Ionescu had played in Muscat until Friday, reaching the mixed doubles semi-finals with Bernadette Szőcs.",
  "Düsseldorf were already ahead. Anton Källberg, the world No 27, came from 2-1 down to beat Franziska, Saarbrücken's world No 11, 11-7 in the fifth game. After Ionescu levelled, Kanak Jha lost the first two games to Alvaro Robles 11-8 and 11-2 and then won the next three. Fan then beat Franziska 14-12, 11-7, 11-7 in front of 2,800 spectators.",
  "## Bad Homburg win in the doubles",
  "Bad Königshofen led twice. Filip Zeljko beat Benno Oehme 11-4 in the fifth game and later beat Juan Perez 3-1, but Perez had beaten Andre Bertelsmeier and Csaba Andras had come back from two games down against Bastian Steger to win 11-8 in the fifth. Ivor Ban and Andras then won the deciding doubles 11-4, 11-9, 11-4. Bad Homburg are fifth with 10 points; Bad Königshofen are 11th.",
  "## Fulda-Maberzell sweep Grünwettersbach",
  "Fanbo Meng beat Tiago Apolonia 3-0, Ovtcharov came from a game down to beat Tobias Hippler, and Jonathan Groth beat Florian Bluhm in four games. Ovtcharov, 38, lost to Shunsuke Togami in the Muscat quarter-finals on Friday. Grünwettersbach are bottom on game difference, level on four points with Bad Königshofen and TTC Bergneustadt.",
  "## Still to play",
  "TTC Grenzau play TTC Bergneustadt on Sunday evening. On Monday Post SV Mühlhausen play Borussia Dortmund (5.30pm UK) and Ochsenhausen play Werder Bremen (6pm UK). Live scores and the table are on Eleven's [Bundesliga page](/clubs/bundesliga.html)."
 ],
